            "notes": "Round 2 -\n\n[Enhanced Target Sensors](item_d2e9e06c-5315-4ddb-b86a-d0397bd4dbbd) is essential for this build. It gives you +25% extra damage to enemies more than 12m away \u2014 including both weapon and ability damage. You\u2019ll tear through distant enemies.\n\nPick up both [Enhanced Target Sensors](item_d2e9e06c-5315-4ddb-b86a-d0397bd4dbbd) and [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) However, if you're facing a Junker Queen, consider switching Shieldbuster for, [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) to deal with her better.\n\nYou\u2019ll likely have more than $9,000 this round, so it\u2019s smart to invest in extra weapon power.",
