            "notes": "Round 3 - \n\nThis is a major power spike, especially for the Orisa/Bastion combo. Because this build focuses heavily on weapon speed and damage, Orisa will need to reload often.\n\nThat\u2019s where [Shield Divergence](item_6577581c-389a-466b-af28-158e2a11ac37) comes in. Paired with [Electro Lights](item_d4ac5963-81ea-41b8-bc26-71905fadf860) ,you\u2019ll have near-constant shields, giving you both defense and an escape option.\n\nTip: Begin shooting around corners to pre-deploy shields before engaging fully. Keep firing to sustain shield uptime.\n\nIf you\u2019ve played efficiently, you should now be able to afford [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48), [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) \u2014 the third most important perk in this build. It gives +20% weapon speed, boosting both damage and shield generation.\n\nIf not get some weapon speed and damage by picking up a mix of blue and green perks.",
