            "notes": "Round 4 -\n\nYour pick this round depends on the enemy comp. If you\u2019re facing armored tanks like Orisa, Rein, or D.Va, go for [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)\u2014 it works great with [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) to melt armor. \n\nIf you have the gold, your priority should be [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b). It helps in close combat and offers solid all-around damage.\n\nIf you just cannot afford it, [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is also a good replacement.",
